---
title: Example · Cart to shipment
config:
  look: classic
  theme: dark
  themeCSS: |
    /* box labels set no color and inherit the page's */
    foreignObject span { color: #e0e0e0; }
---
%% `tf NN type Name` adds a time frame; types: `ui` screen · `cmd` command · `evt` event · `rmo` read model · `pcr` processor.
%% Relations are inferred from order; `rf` starts a new chain, `->> NN` (repeatable) adds explicit sources, `Namespace.Name` gives each namespace and entity type its own lane.
%% Data: inline `{ field: type }` or `[[Block]]` with a separate `data Block { … }`; a backticked type such as `` `json` `` may precede the braces.
%% Long forms: `timeframe` for `tf`, `resetframe` for `rf`, and `command` · `event` · `readmodel` · `processor` for the short types.
eventmodeling
tf 01 ui CartScreen
tf 02 cmd AddItem { sku: string, qty: number }
tf 03 evt ItemAdded [[ItemAdded]]
tf 04 rmo CartView ->> 03
tf 05 ui CheckoutScreen
tf 06 cmd PlaceOrder
tf 07 evt OrderPlaced
rf 08 evt Payments.PaymentCaptured
tf 09 pcr FulfilmentProcessor
tf 10 cmd ShipOrder
tf 11 evt OrderShipped
timeframe 12 readmodel OrderStatusView ->> 07 ->> 11 `json`{ "status": "shipped" }
data ItemAdded {
  sku: string
  qty: number
  price: number
}
